Usage of logstat:
logstat sums up web server access logs.
  -by key
    	count the top keys by key (default "path")
  -json
    	write the summary as one line of JSON
  -strict
    	exit with status 1 when a line cannot be read
  -top n
    	list the n most frequent keys (default 5)
Arguments:
  file...
    	the logs to read; none reads standard input
